-- plain.80x24 --
    ┌─ HELP ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── rex v1 ─┐
  ∴ │   ── Navigation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────   │    
  al│   j k  move row selection                                            │    
    │   g G  top / bottom                                                  │
────│   tab  next Ready session                                            │────
    │   1-4  jump to Ready / Waiting / Working / Done (4 also folds a      │
  RE│        long Done column)                                             │    
   ◆│   v    simple / detailed rows (id, model, tokens, AI summary)        │  4m
    │                                                                      │
  WA│   ── Filter & search ─────────────────────────────────────────────   │    
    │   t     cycle tool filter                                            │
    │   /     search the board (every word must match)                     │
  WO│   esc   clear the search                                             │    
 ▸ ⠋│   zh    hide / show completed sections                               │ 11m
   ⠋│   z1-9  hide / show section N                                        │  7s
   ⠋│   z0    show every section                                           │  2h
    │                                                                      │
  DO│   ── Actions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────   │    
   ●│   enter  attach to selected session                                  │  9d
   ✕│   n      new-agent wizard                                            │   -
  ↳ │   ↓ more                                                             │    
────│                                                                      │────
  λ │   j/k scroll · / filter · esc close                                  │    
  en└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    
-- plain.120x40 --
     ┌─ HELP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── rex v1 ─┐
  ∴ R│   ── Navigation ───────────────────────────────────    ── Session commands ─────────────────────────────   │     
  all│   j k  move row selection                              :new                    new-agent wizard            │     
     │   g G  top / bottom                                    :name [text]            rename selected (no text:   │
─────│   tab  next Ready session                                                      open editor)                │─────
     │   1-4  jump to Ready / Waiting / Working / Done (4     :rename <s> <slug>      change slug                 │
  REA│        also folds a long Done column)                  :done [sel]             mark done                   │     
   ◆ │   v    simple / detailed rows (id, model, tokens,      :undone [sel]           undo done                   │   4m
     │        AI summary)                                     :uc :resume [sel]       undo done: unmark a         │
  WAI│                                                                                running session, or         │     
     │   ── Filter & search ──────────────────────────────                            resume an exited one        │
     │   t     cycle tool filter                              :rid [sel]              show the full resume id     │
  WOR│   /     search the board (every word must match)       :complete [sel]         kill agent + mark done      │     
 ▸ ⠋ │   esc   clear the search                                                       now                         │  11m
   ⠋ │   zh    hide / show completed sections                 :rm <sel>               delete                      │   7s
   ⠋ │   z1-9  hide / show section N                          :prune                  clear Done (keeps           │   2h
     │   z0    show every section                                                     sessions still working)     │
  DON│                                                        :export [sel] [fmt]     write session to exports/   │     
   ● │   ── Actions ──────────────────────────────────────    :loop pause|resume|st…  pause, resume or stop a     │   9d
   ✕ │   enter  attach to selected session                                            loop (stop asks first)      │    -
   ✕ │   n      new-agent wizard                                                      (off)                       │    -
     │   r      rename selected (empty = slug)                :loops                  list loops: state, turn,    │
     │   cc     mark done / undo                                                      time, last check (off)      │
     │   uc     undo done (unmark, or resume an exited        :filter [what]          tool, or hide|show|only     │
     │          session)                                                              <section…>; no argument     │
     │   C      complete now (kill agent, mark done)                                  clears every filter         │
     │   dd     delete selected                               :search [text]          search the board (every     │
     │   i      focus λ prompt (new-session text)                                     word must match); no text   │
     │   S      settings                                                              clears                      │
     │   p      pause / resume the selected loop (off)                                                            │
     │   x      stop the selected loop (asks first) (off)     ── App commands ─────────────────────────────────   │
     │   L      list loops: state, turn, time, last check     :q :quit         quit (confirm)                     │
     │          (off)                                         :q!              force quit                         │
     │   q      quit (confirm)                                :bg :detach      detach, save place                 │
     │                                                        :reload          reload tools.yaml, config.yaml     │
     │   ── Mouse ────────────────────────────────────────                     and themes                         │
